    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given an N \u00d7 M grid of characters and a target word, determine whether the word can be formed by traversing adjacent cells. Adjacent cells are horizontally or vertically neighboring. A cell may not be used more than once in a path. Solve the problem recursively.",
